0..74 Comment "// A program handed the ambient authority, printing through the console it"
75..92 Comment "// opens from it."
93..95 Comment "//"
96..172 Comment "// Authority enters a program in one place, as `main`\'s parameter, and never"
173..244 Comment "// through a global. A Rust program on `cap-std` opens each handle from"
245..283 Comment "// `ambient_authority()` the same way."
284..286 Comment "//"
287..364 Comment "// `gandr run` hands `main` one capability that no handler introduced, so the"
365..441 Comment "// host serves each print. `console` narrows it to `print` by subtyping, and"
442..494 Comment "// `gandr run console.gandr` prints `hello, world!`."
495..497 Comment "//"
498..570 Comment "// - see: `../../../library/std/src/authority.gandr` — `Authority` and"
571..585 Comment "//   `console`"
586..643 Comment "// - see: #2970 — the ambient authority `main` is given"
645..671 Comment "// `Authority`, `console`."
